{"id":"u_ltimo","lemma":"último","pos":"adj","rank":411,"glosses":["final; last","latest; most recent; last so far"],"ipa":"/ˈuw.t͡ʃi.mu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6c/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-%C3%BAltimo.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-%C3%BAltimo.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"última","masculinePlural":"últimos","femininePlural":"últimas"},"formAudio":{"última":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-%C3%BAltima.wav","últimos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-%C3%BAltimos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom foi o último a entrar.","en":"Tom was the last to enter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/963471","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to enter"}]},{"text":"Esse é o meu último projeto.","en":"This is my last project.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/269760","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"my, mine"},null,{"g":"project"}]},{"text":"Os últimos anos foram difíceis para mim.","en":"The last few years have been difficult for me.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"year","l":"ano"},null,{"g":"difficult","l":"difícil"},{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Eu fui o último a saber.","en":"I was the last one to know.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"namely, i.e., to wit"]]},{"text":"Temos feito isso nos últimos três anos.","en":"We've been doing that for the last three years.","words":[{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"like"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"us","l":"nós"},null,{"g":"three"},{"g":"year","l":"ano"}]}]}